	background-image: url("data:image/svg+xml;charset=UTF-8,%3Csvg%20width%3D%2216%22%20height%3D%2216%22%20viewBox%3D%220%200%2016%2016%22%20fill%3D%22none%22%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%3E%0A%3Crect%20x%3D%220.75%22%20y%3D%220.75%22%20width%3D%2214.5%22%20height%3D%2214.5%22%20fill%3D%22white%22%20stroke%3D%22%2336352F%22%20stroke-width%3D%221.5%22%2F%3E%0A%3C%2Fsvg%3E");
}
	
</style></head><body class="pdf ko-KR" lang="ko-KR"><article id="341d015d-d7ae-8040-b1c9-eb508634c815" class="page sans"><header><h1 class="page-title" dir="auto">6주차_6장(6.1.5)</h1><p class="page-description" dir="auto"></p></header><div class="page-body"><div style="display:contents" dir="auto"><h3 id="341d015d-d7ae-80fe-b224-dc728dd67d20" class="">[ 6.1.5 ResNet ]</h3></div><div style="display:contents" dir="auto"><ul id="341d015d-d7ae-802a-af3c-c23b3233e2ea" class="bulleted-list"><li style="list-style-type:disc">ResNet: 깊어진 신경망을 효과적으로 학습하기 위한 방법으로 레지듀얼 개념 고안</li></ul></div><div style="display:contents" dir="auto"><ul id="341d015d-d7ae-8001-b308-e68eb22b8cef" class="bulleted-list"><li style="list-style-type:disc">신경망은 깊이가 깊어질수록 성능이 좋아지다가 일정한 단계에 다다르면 오히려 성능이 나빠진다<br/>→ 이 문제를 해결하기 위해 레지듀얼 블록 도입</li></ul></div><div style="display:contents" dir="auto"><ul id="341d015d-d7ae-80b5-a024-e8e10d96fc36" class="bulleted-list"><li style="list-style-type:disc">레지듀얼 블록 : 기울기가 잘 전파될 수 있도록 일종의 숏컷을 만들어줌</li></ul></div><div style="display:contents" dir="auto"><ul id="341d015d-d7ae-8002-8bb5-c30d1db296fb" class="bulleted-list"><li style="list-style-type:disc">ResNet 이해<div style="display:contents" dir="auto"><ul id="341d015d-d7ae-8027-8c48-ca22226b0788" class="bulleted-list"><li style="list-style-type:circle">합성곱층을 하나의 블록으로 묶음</li></ul></div><div style="display:contents" dir="auto"><ul id="341d015d-d7ae-80c0-b94c-db20fd48bff6" class="bulleted-list"><li style="list-style-type:circle">블록을 구분했는데 이렇게 묶인 계층들을 하나의 레지듀얼 블록이라 함</li></ul></div><div style="display:contents" dir="auto"><ul id="341d015d-d7ae-8066-9fcb-e3f274d1dde0" class="bulleted-list"><li style="list-style-type:circle">레지듀얼 블록을 여러 개 쌓은 것을 ResNet</li></ul></div><div style="display:contents" dir="auto"><p id="341d015d-d7ae-80c0-924b-f7be8a9a60d5" class="">→ 파라미터 수에 문제 발생, 이를 해결하기 위해 병목 블록 도입</p></div></li></ul></div><div style="display:contents" dir="ltr"><figure id="341d015d-d7ae-8001-9b23-dbfc03609602" class="image"><img style="width:288px" src="https://prod-files-secure.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/7d4ec2f8-003a-4fac-ab08-e07004be3ee5/2d2e24c5-5984-4810-9df3-c898c6c11fd4/image.png?X-Amz-Algorithm=AWS4-HMAC-SHA256&amp;X-Amz-Content-Sha256=UNSIGNED-PAYLOAD&amp;X-Amz-Credential=ASIAZI2LB4665KMRSYG4%2F20260413%2Fus-west-2%2Fs3%2Faws4_request&amp;X-Amz-Date=20260413T112652Z&amp;X-Amz-Expires=21600&amp;X-Amz-Security-Token=IQoJb3JpZ2luX2VjEKv%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2FwEaCXVzLXdlc3QtMiJIMEYCIQDyi5rZ560KlMjHYQgoLHqv3F5YPavGPQpJIr7mBnEDhAIhAKtNOr8LU7AHWuRJOemcgG3eE1eRObrNbdFAjRkUjaBRKv8DCHQQABoMNjM3NDIzMTgzODA1IgxNgl62P%2BYCqZh5cYQq3AOOLn1aEZBzFk88wHh2OY5XB10mj8mQ6wpNV2Qpu0iS3xOZr1PgIP%2BV0JkkhQgJf%2FVOSHhtboG1Xtk7AjAxUfVDTqKqksL1oriqpPvu2wjX%2BdZL1Qt2LWkMAyaV%2FQQj884k49l69g3JmblC84SshWFxLxzjhHrfOintRa4icwEwWXF3igzrX08cKABIamigx8bMqnCDDcrSqKm4k01gPjOb85RUYcF8c67Ig3b%2BdZcalE7xMERZ83ZEbB2lUSglAY2cjSXuxjOMsLdYfe4mpj51hQ3eyrAqsu7d8p7MwXi%2FDRt5EM6EmQKbI2UpKgv76sbPWc%2FF9ySN5PrG%2BUxK1Otdqx8ye75mcS4ry0RT4q7mYdL%2BRYTWli39eozMUTzaD1RHYCFx%2B5U7DOKjZM0GaLg7lhNPWgpwUUFusXo0EyMlemp%2BIAyjUTphFFlZLEIU%2FpHaCGfeV0XaXMH9xcUboAODFUQPWRGKLyV9Y8xBjHHa7Y4iqbMdtFHt%2BbBkVCnXiDPJVyonmdA6gFt%2Bw0Pm7a4qI6FlcsTEgNAXRXuHR%2FnWsyKWFZ%2F50z%2BRQKrdpI8Fi465rS3%2B0ZVmCwhDijJPSA5ZQCWPgDAWits1kiI7E62hEIDsvDLtHm%2BaaeB8qTCCnvPOBjqkAS0Zia2mC2%2BLIdwavpUdZ0cPXrlUFY3096sHWbLk6T89QzUcRUl5AALpVwIqQl1jdrngtyQjTwNH3UHwV80eZ8ryVD4eEoQ7wTnyzCLpPb%2Blu2JTQqKmjtEr7b7LGIh1JYrNx7ExGzhtdyo5EE2m%2BcwKGLiYCl38f7H2vmB41md7yE%2BuvKx2FtvZA0PJuGothuEz2zWUsQc3YIAeZF9%2BdYnChRw7&amp;X-Amz-Signature=8de4ad33e9bbbdd8430746605d1819b51504f85045bafee1eb5b4aa730a48ce3&amp;X-Amz-SignedHeaders=host&amp;x-amz-checksum-mode=ENABLED&amp;x-id=GetObject"/></figure></div><div style="display:contents" dir="auto"><ul id="341d015d-d7ae-80be-af4a-fb505619b923" class="bulleted-list"><li style="list-style-type:disc">ResNet 34는 기본 블록, 50은 병목 블록 사용 → 깊이가 깊어져도 파라미터 수는 감소<div style="display:contents" dir="auto"><ul id="341d015d-d7ae-8065-85c8-f1b8b199d7d6" class="bulleted-list"><li style="list-style-type:circle">ResNet34와는 다르게 ResNet50에서는 3×3 합성곱층 앞뒤로 1×1 합성곱층이 붙어 있는데, 1×1 합성곱층의 채널 수를 조절하면서 차원을 줄였다 늘리는 것이 가능하기 때문에 파라미터 수를 줄일 수 있었던 것</li></ul></div></li></ul></div><div style="display:contents" dir="auto"><ul id="341d015d-d7ae-8077-9ca6-c3c4167d2cde" class="bulleted-list"><li style="list-style-type:disc">아이덴티티 매핑<div style="display:contents" dir="auto"><ul id="341d015d-d7ae-8060-a6af-f1425e214e2d" class="bulleted-list"><li style="list-style-type:circle">입력값이 어떤 함수를 통과해도 다시 입력값으로 출력</li></ul></div><div style="display:contents" dir="auto"><ul id="341d015d-d7ae-80a5-aee6-d3463e4a204f" class="bulleted-list"><li style="list-style-type:circle">입력값 = 출력값</li></ul></div></li></ul></div><div style="display:contents" dir="ltr"><figure id="341d015d-d7ae-8054-a884-dbf038d46982" class="image"><img style="width:500.9875183105469px" src="https://prod-files-secure.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/7d4ec2f8-003a-4fac-ab08-e07004be3ee5/b2a459c8-1522-499c-9474-240acd327f7b/image.png?X-Amz-Algorithm=AWS4-HMAC-SHA256&amp;X-Amz-Content-Sha256=UNSIGNED-PAYLOAD&amp;X-Amz-Credential=ASIAZI2LB4665KMRSYG4%2F20260413%2Fus-west-2%2Fs3%2Faws4_request&amp;X-Amz-Date=20260413T112652Z&amp;X-Amz-Expires=21600&amp;X-Amz-Security-Token=IQoJb3JpZ2luX2VjEKv%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2FwEaCXVzLXdlc3QtMiJIMEYCIQDyi5rZ560KlMjHYQgoLHqv3F5YPavGPQpJIr7mBnEDhAIhAKtNOr8LU7AHWuRJOemcgG3eE1eRObrNbdFAjRkUjaBRKv8DCHQQABoMNjM3NDIzMTgzODA1IgxNgl62P%2BYCqZh5cYQq3AOOLn1aEZBzFk88wHh2OY5XB10mj8mQ6wpNV2Qpu0iS3xOZr1PgIP%2BV0JkkhQgJf%2FVOSHhtboG1Xtk7AjAxUfVDTqKqksL1oriqpPvu2wjX%2BdZL1Qt2LWkMAyaV%2FQQj884k49l69g3JmblC84SshWFxLxzjhHrfOintRa4icwEwWXF3igzrX08cKABIamigx8bMqnCDDcrSqKm4k01gPjOb85RUYcF8c67Ig3b%2BdZcalE7xMERZ83ZEbB2lUSglAY2cjSXuxjOMsLdYfe4mpj51hQ3eyrAqsu7d8p7MwXi%2FDRt5EM6EmQKbI2UpKgv76sbPWc%2FF9ySN5PrG%2BUxK1Otdqx8ye75mcS4ry0RT4q7mYdL%2BRYTWli39eozMUTzaD1RHYCFx%2B5U7DOKjZM0GaLg7lhNPWgpwUUFusXo0EyMlemp%2BIAyjUTphFFlZLEIU%2FpHaCGfeV0XaXMH9xcUboAODFUQPWRGKLyV9Y8xBjHHa7Y4iqbMdtFHt%2BbBkVCnXiDPJVyonmdA6gFt%2Bw0Pm7a4qI6FlcsTEgNAXRXuHR%2FnWsyKWFZ%2F50z%2BRQKrdpI8Fi465rS3%2B0ZVmCwhDijJPSA5ZQCWPgDAWits1kiI7E62hEIDsvDLtHm%2BaaeB8qTCCnvPOBjqkAS0Zia2mC2%2BLIdwavpUdZ0cPXrlUFY3096sHWbLk6T89QzUcRUl5AALpVwIqQl1jdrngtyQjTwNH3UHwV80eZ8ryVD4eEoQ7wTnyzCLpPb%2Blu2JTQqKmjtEr7b7LGIh1JYrNx7ExGzhtdyo5EE2m%2BcwKGLiYCl38f7H2vmB41md7yE%2BuvKx2FtvZA0PJuGothuEz2zWUsQc3YIAeZF9%2BdYnChRw7&amp;X-Amz-Signature=cf275bc632db50400b717f03f621d7089a55c7a340eb482c10a9cbdd7cdd056a&amp;X-Amz-SignedHeaders=host&amp;x-amz-checksum-mode=ENABLED&amp;x-id=GetObject"/></figure></div><div style="display:contents" dir="auto"><ul id="341d015d-d7ae-8089-84fa-f765f0942f0f" class="bulleted-list"><li style="list-style-type:disc">다운 샘플: 크기를 줄이기 위한 것, 풀링과 같은 역할</li></ul></div><div style="display:contents" dir="auto"><ul id="341d015d-d7ae-80ea-9a9a-eb86aca1954a" class="bulleted-list"><li style="list-style-type:disc">프로젝션 숏컷 / 합성곱 블록: 입력 및 출력 차원이 동일하지 않고 입력의 차원을 출력에 맞추어 변경해야 하는 것</li></ul></div><div style="display:contents" dir="auto"><p id="341d015d-d7ae-80e3-b9dd-fb7daee8f9b9" class="">⇒ ResNet은 기본적으로 VGG19 구조를 뼈대로 하며, 거기에 합성곱층들을 추가해서 깊게 만든 후 숏컷들을 추가하는 것</p></div></div></article></body></html>